            ("Listen to the pump.", "Run a Spin Only cycle. If you hear the pump humming but the water does not go down, the filter is likely blocked."),
            ("Clean the drain pump filter (front loaders).", "Put a shallow pan under the small residual drain hose at the bottom front, drain the water, then twist out the filter and remove lint and debris. The water may be hot."),
